# Zen Workbench: Caffeine, which keeps the computer awake. English is the source language (ADR-0024).

workbench-caffeine-unavailable = Caffeine is not available on this system: it needs caffeinate (macOS) or systemd-inhibit (Linux)
workbench-caffeine-minutes = Caffeine can be turned on for at most { $max } minutes
workbench-caffeine-while-empty = Choose at least one thing for Caffeine to watch: a run, a debug session, a background task, indexing or an agent
